<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66259" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέμψις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blame, censure</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέμψιν δικαίαν μέμφομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἐπιφέρειν τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					1253
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. λαβεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					576
				</span></i>
			 (s. v. l.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχειν μ.</span> to
			incur <i>blame</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Heracl.</u>
				974
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλων μ.</span>
			<i>censure</i> of them, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				472
			</span></i>: pl., <i>censures</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				684d
			</span></i>; <i>complaints</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1162b5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>ground of complaint</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. οὔτιν᾽ ἀνθρώποις ἔχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					445
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1309
			</span></i>.</div>
